{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "d107fffd9817776bc42da08dedfc77639a1f9c73358bd8819b910164a8e68161", "ja": "天使たちのファッション対決", "zh": "天使们的时尚对决", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b48be8b15373664a69d3dfc93865943f290a05970608440a843d796ba78acad8", "ja": "バラエティ番組に出演した翼たち。\n番組の内容であるオシャレ勝負に火花を散ら\nすが、番組の最後の告知コーナーでは一致団\n結し、番組も宣伝も大成功に導く。", "zh": "翼等人参加了综艺节目。\n虽然成员们因节目内容的时尚对决而激起火花，\n但在节目尾声的宣传时间再度团结一心，\n让节目和宣传都圆满结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "173df9b75875d1ec9a4722e12eb65e21edc3db2d5ed9f42d831d914e1282a890", "ja": "（Angelチームのお披露目公演の告知も兼ねて、\nバラエティ番組に出演することになった！）", "zh": "（为了兼替Angel队首次亮相公演宣传，\n决定要让偶像们参加综艺节目了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "06192281a61cb4a425ddd7021b3e888a8737cb257d0a67477ee629314239d1ae", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "06192281a61cb4a425ddd7021b3e888a8737cb257d0a67477ee629314239d1ae", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "01082b1a48ec648638707b3be1f1a24999fb0f6f2aada627b3a493d12f5b12ca", "ja": "なんだ、二人そろってニヤニヤして……。", "zh": "你们两个怎么在那边偷笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "48b75b4cbcbbd3d1a6467353924f30bf16da55dbef55f37df04bb5430cb31df8", "ja": "亜美たちにこの仕事を任せるなんて……\nさすがヤリ手だね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "居然把这种工作交给亚美我们……\n你还真精明呢，大哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "e658dac1cb29647ba43a32851969658468a35d46ccb05dbce2c1aa91dbb21c6a", "ja": "真美たちが駄菓子屋さんできたえた買い物センス、\nばっちり見せつけるよ！　楽しみにしててね♪", "zh": "该让大家见识见识真美我们在怀旧零嘴店\n锻炼出来的购物品味了！好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d5651396e17431f427eb1c8474d29da4668cced730c1cb55e9208e3ea77538c3", "ja": "いや、それは今回役に立たないんじゃないかな。\nとにかく、ちゃんとやろうな！", "zh": "不，我想这次应该派不上用场吧。\n总之要好好表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b79ab4154ed703a36d539024388c9c7ef6ca6ad65d48ebe5f63f5dd36fcfda39", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん。\n今回のお仕事って、お洋服を買えばいいんですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n这次的工作，只要买到漂亮衣服就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "435034b8193d825cac7cee86c6800cfe5a694e82746eb310dab5e2bde7148687", "ja": "予算5000円で、1番カワイイコーデができたら、\nわたしの勝ちなんですよね？", "zh": "只要我能在5000日圆预算内完成最可爱的穿搭造型，\n就赢了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0b45c256004c8b2937576b4c21a413c4560a1732111dae1171b464b716780e2e", "ja": "ああ。台本によると……アイドルによるプチプライス\nファッションのコーディネートがテーマだそうだ。", "zh": "是啊，从节目脚本来看……\n主题似乎是偶像的平价时尚穿搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d7a04125bf65cfe1da7830cc25fb37258f251e3e7d7e5d7c6d241d3c5a485a53", "ja": "会場の審査員と、視聴者投票で勝敗が決まるらしい。\n頑張れよ、翼！", "zh": "据说是由会场评审和观众投票来决定胜负，\n加油吧，翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6cc4d6926252aebd2f0f810b19f2604ada965d93ce5d577575a6bb414a7027d9", "ja": "は～い♪　毎回こういうお仕事なら、楽しいのにな～。\nえへへ、本気出しちゃお～っと♪", "zh": "好～♪要是每次都是这种工作，那可就开心了～\n嘿嘿，我要拿出真本事啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "3d3c42d59d10118f2cae3844eb50eb4823af9d828f1097302ef36cce8b73ac83", "ja": "おおっ！\nバサバサ、珍しくやる気マンマンだね？", "zh": "哦哦！\n飞飞，难得看你这么有干劲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "c48c4dd94297a5018931fd1920713a96e7b01c979942979194548b186dd9dc37", "ja": "だが、そうはいかないぜ！\n真美たちも、珍しくマンマンだぜ！", "zh": "但你是赢不了的！\n真美我们也难得充满干劲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5cdf551e8fec975cb8990fa31cae841f2c5c604dda38830e6b6e9868e1fef069", "ja": "はは、自分で言ってどうするんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，这种话怎么好意思自己说啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "e02959220bfa4116c5780612feeb7b4def5d66976d8b79450d53fae478ff6a0a", "ja": "おやぶん、どうしよ～！\nたまき、おしゃれとか、よくわかんない……。", "zh": "老大，怎么办～！\n环不太懂时尚之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "057c2290ca09f631b836b17f217ecfb9fdc0456aeabe1593fc356dfa744c0fa4", "ja": "気にするな、環。みんな自分の着たい服を選ぶだけだ。\n自由にやっていいんだぞ。", "zh": "别担心，环，只是让大家选自己想穿的衣服而已，\n你只要随心所欲挑衣服就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "6215ab0cda4aafb4f2321f594be7bad4fda8d9fe1d57d2d17598b611f3fedb11", "ja": "でもこれって、勝負なんでしょ？\nたまき、勝負なら勝ちたい！", "zh": "但这是比赛吧？\n环只要是比赛就想赢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "27427c290d048d8cf297fa2b8acab0a832854f019fb91beb6c9b47817a94206d", "ja": "そっか～。じゃあ環ちゃん、私と一緒に選ばない？\nふたりでやれば、一番になれるかも♪", "zh": "这样啊～那小环要不要和我一起选？\n两个人一起选，说不定就有机会拿下第一名了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "35988f5bab0f4e93a687eebeba927f05569ce2200cbaa402f0b9579886441177", "ja": "ホント？　\nれいか、ありがとう～！", "zh": "真的？\n丽花，谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "e636d015a8f35cbeec1ab1546aec5ca4691fd7055f17940c59863a0ea1207ffa", "ja": "うんうん♪　頑張ろうね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯♪我们加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "61d95541a9d494abd04d582d08296d94e7830f7878ab7d4f7818529da49b0a81", "ja": "たまきちと麗花お姉ちゃんが手を組むの？\nなら真美も、亜美と手を組んじゃおっかな～。", "zh": "阿环和丽花大姊姊要联手吗？\n那真美也来和亚美联手好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "d2b7eb378d845201410555e6bd7fcc40dd9462283de6b0ce989a08a79d1d9bf0", "ja": "うんうん、真美と亜美が入れ替わりの術を使えば、\nポイントも2倍だよ！　超有利だよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，只要真美和亚美使出交换身份之术，\n分数也会变成两倍喔！超有利的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e33221aa4b7ceb96fed08c8a10d7a14f0b96ed90dcafa1b4696535aa75d74da2", "ja": "入れ替わる意味がない気がするが……。\nほら、始まるぞ！", "zh": "总觉得交换身份没什么意义……\n好了，要开始啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1024_null", "source_sha256": "41653696cc58b74d90f461b5071b0b8d7ca2c51eb7877fb67a39562da67d4780", "ja": "撮影開始……", "zh": "节目开拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "977525f540feb48ccb3300e0ff9e925cb6c9a2239118a7235c30ff61682e1b75", "ja": "やっぱり、キレイ系の方がウケるかな？　思いきって\nエスニックとか……う～ん、結構悩みますね～。", "zh": "还是走气质路线比较吃香吗？\n或是干脆走民族风……嗯～还挺伤脑筋的耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b80b5386fa52b2b125614eb926a03abbf497678b0baf90217f59820d91891bdf", "ja": "あ、そうだ♪　ねえ{$P$}さん、\nこの服、どっちがいいか選んでくれませんか？", "zh": "啊，对了♪欸，{$P$}先生，\n你可以帮我选哪个比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2ebd5915a8ff8628d8c0ad25adb4394549d412c589311dc69aba748e68f60091", "ja": "{$P$}さんが選んでくれた服なら、\n絶対わたしに似合うと思うんだけどな♪", "zh": "我想，{$P$}先生帮我选的衣服\n一定很适合我的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "45abd1012732a0d30de3bef3eba8a17d89292733bf29e1a7b772a6d41b3612a6", "ja": "翼、撮影中だぞ。\nそんなに俺に話しかけたらダメじゃないか。", "zh": "翼，现在正在拍摄喔，\n不该这样跑来和我说话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0ff52836694b5cf59550e6989bd50c0ef4d1be96839736a841d35b524b131934", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ～。買い物中のシーンは、ほとんど\nカットされちゃうってスタッフさんも言ってましたし♪", "zh": "没关系的～工作人员也说过，\n购物时的场景几乎都会被剪掉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "545f1cadd3a8513b52aea6b0e135fb5c7838cb50fec0b955ec28e156f63bd5d2", "ja": "カットされる前提で仕事しちゃダメだ。\nたまにならいいけどな。ほら、戻って戻って。", "zh": "不可以抱着反正都会剪掉的心态来工作，\n偶尔一下就算了。好了，快回去快回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2ac91c3cc54f5fbb9088f2d87233a51c2d85a70e21c62813c06d809685e7ab0f", "ja": "む～。\n{$P$}さんのイジワル！", "zh": "呜～\n{$P$}先生好坏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "25d416010b641c4a29400a3c96ec5366e0f28086794fddf79b7827162ec94826", "ja": "環ちゃん、環ちゃん！\nこれ、どうかな？　とっても可愛いと思うんだけど！", "zh": "小环、小环！\n这个怎么样？我觉得很可爱耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "f9d989ee14be0c868769bea03600655fd2114ac88c34992959132ca72d4093ed", "ja": "……？　れいか、それ、ぬいぐるみ？\nぬいぐるみ着るの？", "zh": "……？丽花，那是布偶吗？\n要把布偶穿在身上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "e57442b53b70a8cb8d059ecd11f09e72a6ca4ef13ea9fa75188b55bfab6ec7ac", "ja": "うん♪　ほら、着ぐるみのパジャマなんだよ♪\nお揃いでどうかな？", "zh": "嗯♪你看，这是布偶装睡衣喔♪\n我们买一对的怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "8ca4281ea3591555f6bfb847a858b5b5ba804a6801480a7247a6a1345e8f05b4", "ja": "おお～……！　れいか、オオカミは？\nたまき、オオカミがいい！", "zh": "喔喔……！丽花，大野狼如何？\n环想要大野狼的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "be3d8d6340852f345a4f3cfa07ee9c062f6e8516287576654117e7705b1be1df", "ja": "着ぐるみはありなんだろうか……まぁいいか。", "zh": "布偶装真的可行吗……算了，随她们去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "786f46b47dd99f29aa60abfd1626d02192cf85454adc018bad746fcd556b676a", "ja": "むむむ……真美、やっぱバサバサは手ごわいかも？\nそれに、麗花お姉ちゃん達もなかなかやるよ！", "zh": "唔唔唔……真美，飞飞果然不好对付！\n而且丽花大姊姊她们也很有一套！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "df997c3c5b31cd6a8db81abe41cc8fba11596120637ab4cc0f0468dc5b00effd", "ja": "くっ、こうなったら真美たちは……\nもう脱ぐしかないよね、兄ちゃん！？", "zh": "呜，这样的话真美我们……\n也只能脱了对吧，大哥哥！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_1039", "source_sha256": "eba72159de90e482d67fd1f95b3e5c519a51c0247372940b2b7feee81adc61f3", "ja": "目を覚ませ！", "zh": "醒醒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b86bfa778bc2bd5aeae9f42cad9966b30954df6e484da9dbce0540424028a58b", "ja": "目を覚ませ！　服を買う番組でなぜ……。\nというか、放送できなくなるから、やめてくれないか？", "zh": "醒醒吧！为什么要在买衣服的节目这样做……\n而且这样就不能播出了，拜托你们别乱来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2001_011ami", "source_sha256": "d132f93253cf37fcb45ee9e7b7a1a164520e945ce366e3f30fbadae045384cb0", "ja": "え～。もー、しょうがないな～。\nじゃあ、普通に服を選んだげるよ～。", "zh": "咦～真是的，拿你没办法～\n那就照常乖乖选衣服吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2002_012mam", "source_sha256": "c3527f53e966969ff19c5e3c50771670106453a28e6e2ae4cb841e165276650f", "ja": "今回だけだかんね、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "下不为例喔，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2003_p", "source_sha256": "5e328b8f60e1ced78c4f21baffbb4978e2dadeabffe690b6d4f1e7b7a8c2b585", "ja": "あ、ああ。助かるよ……。", "zh": "好、好喔，那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2004_p", "source_sha256": "7e4116985edc7fbe2cdeb8c32d6bb0f9398c48d30c8c0b0cb1f43128b7b0b321", "ja": "（その後、撮影はどうにか予定通りに進み……）", "zh": "（接下来，拍摄总算有照计划进行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2005_040tam", "source_sha256": "dd316ff5b0e30c44185a480525e5adce568a65dae60a6231c7d27efbcbb289cb", "ja": "えっ……たまきたちの勝ち！？\nやった～！　おやぶん、たまき、勝ったよ！", "zh": "咦……环我们赢了！？\n太好了～！老大，环赢了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2006_048rei", "source_sha256": "89ddce91944f42d519348e476759eb827df1c58c4bcb211a8a2bcc1fac49b636", "ja": "ふふっ、やったね環ちゃん♪\n子オオカミさん、とっても可愛かったもんね♪", "zh": "呵呵，太好了，小环♪\n毕竟小野狼真的很可爱嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2007_p", "source_sha256": "7b357a5ff1b1a2797c6340bc2819de18db127b1ce584170b7f64798f143faba5", "ja": "ああ、えらかったな、環！\nそれと、翼は……そう落ち込まずにな。", "zh": "是啊，真了不起呢，环！\n还有翼……别那么沮丧了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "68daa4caa3646b6e7ad7dbed03c62b1f4c9819971bccef34abf9554565b2ac1d", "ja": "う～っ、投票はわたしが一番だったのに、予算100円\nオーバーしただけで～。納得いかないですよ～！", "zh": "呜～我的得票数明明最高，却因为超出预算\n100日圆而输掉～我不能接受～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2009_p", "source_sha256": "958799f823643b16d5fd485af3de9655149a80c2ad0ac960be9fd031d658bcdb", "ja": "まあまあ。\n番組的には盛り上がって、大成功だったと思うぞ。", "zh": "好了好了，\n以节目效果来说倒是炒热了气氛，我认为很成功喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2010_011ami", "source_sha256": "3d567c39d9e146df6ce7d4dd259bef48791ac9455b05630c2bc8c525be93d8c6", "ja": "納得いかないのは亜美たちの方だよ！\nなんで投票で最下位なの！？", "zh": "无法接受的是亚美我们啦！\n为什么得票数是最后一名呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2011_p", "source_sha256": "0499f28bfda5f48e21dfcc920d8f38493786d38b53fc9ef7a7fff877d7364ed6", "ja": "な、なんでだろうな。\nあやしいのはマグロ柄のニットだと思うが……。", "zh": "是、是为什么呢～\n我觉得问题出在鲔鱼图案的毛衣啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_02_2012_p", "source_sha256": "71827657fbf690314061d6adfc1b2aa360ffa37a581278163b5419a935888622", "ja": "とにかく、みんなお疲れ様。\n最後に公演の宣伝、ビシッと頼むぞ！", "zh": "总之大家辛苦了，\n最后就拜托大家好好宣传公演啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
